[
  "Linux",
  "AWS",
  "Ansible"
]

3. dict2items
--------------

Definition:
Used to convert a dictionary into a list of key-value pairs.

Syntax:
{{ dictionary | dict2items }}

Example:

vars:
  Course:
    name: Ansible
    duration: 30 days
    platform: Udemy

tasks:
- name: Convert dictionary into list
  ansible.builtin.debug:
     msg: "{{ Course | dict2items }}"
	 
