*) This command 'ansible-inventory -i Dynamic-inventory-aws.aws_ec2.yaml --graph' only verifies the inventory. It does not run the playbook.


2) Run the Playbook using Dynamic Inventory file:
-------------------------------------------------

Syntax:
-------

ansible-playbook -i <dynamic-inventory> <playbook>

Ex:

ansible-playbook -i Dynamic-inventory-aws.aws_ec2.yaml -e ansible_user=ec2-user -e ansible_password=Devops321 nginx-dynamic-inventory.yaml

